  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 根\ntitle: root; foundation\njlpt: 2\ntags: [jlpt-n2, grade-3, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 10\nradical: 木\nradicalNumber: 75\nonyomi: [コン]\nkunyomi: [ね, -ね]\ndistractors: [銀, 限, 眠]\n---\n\n# 根 — root; foundation\n\n**Strokes:** 10 · **Key (radical):** 木 (no. 75) · **JLPT:** N2 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n根 concerns a root or underlying basis. 根 ね can be a plant's root, and 根気 こんき means patience or perseverance. In 屋根 やね, the complete word means a roof; do not infer that every compound containing 根 must name a plant part.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic, not etymology:** Notice 木 beside 艮 and imagine a tree held firmly by its roots. This is a modern-shape memory aid, not verified etymology.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| コン | on | 根気 こんき - patience; perseverance |\n| ね | kun | [根](../words/根.md) ね - root |\n| -ね | kun | [屋根](../words/屋根.md) やね - roof; word-final ね |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [根](../words/根.md) ね - root\n- [屋根](../words/屋根.md) やね - roof\n- [垣根](../words/垣根.md) かきね - hedge; fence; figurative barrier\n- 根気 こんき - patience; perseverance\n\n## Notes\n\n- The -ね row shows a bound occurrence in 屋根 やね, not a second way to pronounce that whole word.\n- The linked 根 article teaches the native noun ね. The コン example is the compound 根気, not a replacement pronunciation to apply to every independent use of 根.\n- [羽根](../words/羽.md) はね is a spelling of the feather/wing word and can also name a shuttlecock. Learn the complete word rather than interpreting it as a literal plant root.\n- Compare [銀](銀.md) and [限](限.md): the shared-looking right side does not make their meanings or complete word readings identical.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project), 2026-10-21 snapshot. Word pairs: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1182700, 1290020, 1290110, 1204800, 1171680.\n",
